ture</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Structural BIM Engineers placed onsite, remotely or as part of a dedicated team, <em>each one assessed before you meet them.</em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=Structural%20BIM%20Engineers\">Request Structural BIM Engineers <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Roles we place</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>Structural BIM Engineer</li><li>Structural BIM Modeler</li><li>Structural BIM Coordinator</li><li>Rebar Detailer</li><li>Structural CAD Draftsman</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">On the project</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What they <em>do for you.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"qual qual-dark\">\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Typical responsibilities</p><ul><li>Model columns, walls, slabs, beams and transfer structures to the agreed LOD</li><li>Coordinate openings, sleeves and penetrations with MEP and architecture</li><li>Produce general arrangement and detail drawings</li><li>Support quantity take-off from the structural model</li><li>Prepare models for steel and rebar detailing</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">Software we assess</p><div class=\"chiprow ink-chips\"><span>Revit Structure</span><span>Tekla</span><span>Advance Steel</span><span>Navisworks</span><span>AutoCAD</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">How they can work</p><ul class=\"plain\"><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\">Onsite BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\">Remote BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/outsourcing/\">BIM Resource Outsourcing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\">Dedicated BIM Teams</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/staff-augmentation/\">BIM Staff Augmentation</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\">BIM Workforce Mobilization</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\">BIM Workforce Continuity</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\">Temporary BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/long-term/\">Long-Term BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\">BIM Technical Recruitment</a></li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Need a package instead?</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Related <em>BIM services.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-services/\">All BIM services <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-services/structural-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Structural BIM</b><span>Structure</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/rebar-detailing/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Rebar Detailing</b><span>Reinforcement</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/shop-drawings/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Shop Drawings</b><span>Documentation</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">From the portfolio</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Where this work <em>was delivered.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/case-studies/#register\">Portfolio register <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/case-studies/museum-of-the-future-jet-link-bridge/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Museum of the Future – Jet-Link Bridge</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\"></span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/residential-tower-structure/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Structural BIM Modeling: Residential Tower</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/steel-structure-detailing/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Steel Structure BIM &#038; Detailing: Warehouse &#038; Industrial</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/structural-bim-hotel-and-hospitality-development/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Structural BIM: Hotel &#038; Hospitality Development</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/rebar-detailing-and-structural-quantity-takeoff/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Rebar Detailing &#038; Structural Quantity Takeoff</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300–400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/bridge-and-flyover-structural-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Bridge &#038; Flyover Structural BIM</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300–400</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap faqx\"><div><p class=\"lab\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Hiring <em>Structural BIM Engineers.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Anything else? <a class=\"u\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask ENGISOFT.</a></p></div><div class=\"qa\"><details><summary>Do structural BIM engineers perform design calculations?<i></i></summary><p>BIM modelling is not engineering design sign-off. Calculations stay with the engineer of record unless contracted otherwise.</p></details><details><summary>Can you supply steel and rebar detailers too?<i></i></summary><p>Yes. Steel detailing and rebar detailing specialists are available as part of the structural discipline.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Other disciplines</p><h2 class=\"h2\">More <em>professionals.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/\">Engineering staffing <i